      "content": "The logic you are describing is a very painful way to view yourself, but it is not the truth of your worth. Your presence matters, and your feelings are valid even if they are difficult to manage. Instead of viewing it as taking, try to see what small things might bring you a tiny bit of relief today. Please consider reaching out to a mental health professional; they can help you navigate this overwhelming feeling of being a burden.",
