    "summary": "The user expresses deep feelings of guilt and hopelessness, framing their existence as a burden to their spouse and suggesting that stepping aside might be an act of mercy. The assistant responds by acknowledging the user's pain while repeatedly and explicitly steering them toward professional help and suicide prevention resources.",
